  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      189.21,
      201.67,
      374.5,
      227.37
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DESHAMANYA RAVINDRAWANIGASEKARA FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      237.79,
      402.13,
      310.17
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Organisation called and known as the\u201cDeshamanya Ravindra Wanigasekara Foundation\u201d has beenestablished in Sri Lanka, for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and matters connectedwith the said Organisation according to the rules agreed toby its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      320.35,
      402.05,
      380.97
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Organisation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      391.15,
      401.65,
      416.37
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      426.55,
      401.96,
      451.65
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Deshamanya RavindraWanigasekara Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2010",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      461.95,
      402.06,
      593.25
    ],
    "text": "2. From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many person as now are members of the\u201cDeshamanya Ravindra Wanigasekara Foundation\u201d(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cOrganisation\u201d) or shall hereafterbe admitted members of the Corporation hereby constituted,shall be a body corporate (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession under the nameand style of the \u201cDeshamanya Ravindra WanigasekaraFoundation\u201d and by that name may sue and be sued, in allcourts with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      603.55,
      402.01,
      628.65
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      636.19,
      401.9,
      673.65
    ],
    "text": "(a)to encourage and assist students faced witheconomic or financial difficulties, to pursue highereducation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      462.02,
      455.81,
      493.69
    ],
